## 5. Machine Smoke Hardening

- composite_required_counter_keys_present: True
- missing_required_counter_keys: {}

The smoke fails closed if any critical underlying counter key is missing. This
prevents a renamed or missing safety counter from silently defaulting to zero.
A negative focused test proves missing critical counters flip the smoke to
FAIL.

